  "details": "Recently, in video recording, we can now switch the Audio Listener's position between viewpoint-based and camera-based in both the camera's stream mode and the VRC Drone's FPV mode.\n\nPlease enable access to obtain the player's audio listener position from Udon. This will ensure that world audio sources, which were previously controlled solely based on the player's head position, will now be heard accurately even in stream mode.\n\nThis post has been reposted from the following post, which is more appropriately categorized here:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/determine-whether-the-players-audio-listener-is-viewpoint-based-or-camera-based",
